  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "scan, stage, then fingerprint and classify-cheap on the CPU worker",
        "classify-llm runs on the I/O worker only when the local tiers escalate",
        "reconcile, transfer-small/large through rclone, then verify",
        "Each hand-off is a DBOS enqueue under a deterministic workflow ID"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Isolation",
      "items": [
        "Of the workers, only the I/O pod reaches pCloud and OpenRouter and decrypts provider tokens",
        "The API holds the credential key only to seal the tokens the OAuth exchange returns",
        "The CPU pod decodes untrusted bytes with a read-only reader identity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Durable execution",
      "items": [
        "DBOS system tables live in the ledger database, schema dbos",
        "The I/O worker applies persisted schedules under an advisory-lock authority and re-applies them periodically",
        "Each worker holds an executor lease; the API never launches DBOS and uses DBOSClient",
        "Ledger connections go through a session-mode pooler, as the lease requires",
        "Migrations bring the dbos schema up before the ledger's own revisions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Operations",
      "items": [
        "The API and both workers export spans and redacted log events to Logfire; the API leaves health probes untraced",
        "reset-environment.sh empties the local or dev ledger, dbos schema included, and content/ prefix",
        "The reset keeps pCloud connections unless --drop-connections is given"
      ]
    }
  ]
